      "side": 1,
      "message": "Andrew, few functions sleep_start_suspend(ctx) and sleep_complte_resume(ctx) requires data to be passed, but our current event based framework doesn\u0027t support passing additional data to the callback.\nOne way is to introduce additional function parameter(void *data)to be passed to ap_power_ev_send_callbacks(event, void *data) to address this but we will loss the functionality of passing multiple events in single function call or other way is to pass (struct ap_power_ev_data data) to ap_power_ev_send_callbacks in all calling places. whats your suggestion ?",
